  <div class="speaker-notes">
    <strong>Speaker Notes:</strong> "Compared to traditional municipal helplines or standard web forms, CivicFix AI is in a different league. We integrate live weather APIs, enforce contractor warranties, prevent photo fraud, and offer native Urdu voice recognition that traditional systems simply cannot match."
  </div>
</div>

<div class="slide-card">
  <h3>Slide 14: Strategic Scaling Roadmap</h3>
  <p><strong>Slide Title:</strong> Roadmap: From Pilot to Smart City Infrastructure</p>
  <p><strong>Key Takeaway:</strong> Scalable enterprise rollout strategy across municipal divisions.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Phase 1 (Completed):</strong> Full-stack operational MVP, bilingual intake, urgency simulator, email/WhatsApp notification engine, 283 unit/property tests.</li>
    <li><strong>Phase 2 (Immediate Next Steps):</strong> PostgreSQL cloud migration, Cloudflare R2 / AWS S3 media storage, full Meta WhatsApp verified channel deployment.</li>
    <li><strong>Phase 3 (Smart City Integration):</strong> IoT sewer level sensor integration for proactive auto-ticketing; drone/satellite road crater detection.</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="speaker-notes">
    <strong>Speaker Notes:</strong> "Looking ahead, our architecture is ready for enterprise scale. In Phase 2, we migrate to PostgreSQL and Cloudflare R2 object storage. In Phase 3, we envision connecting municipal IoT sensors directly into our rules engine so sewer backups and water leaks trigger tickets before a citizen even has to report them."
  </div>
</div>

<div class="slide-card">
  <h3>Slide 15: Conclusion & Q&A</h3>
  <p><strong>Slide Title:</strong> Empowering Cities, Protecting Citizens</p>
  <p><strong>Key Takeaway:</strong> Restoring public trust through transparent, AI-driven civic redressal.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Accessible to Every Citizen:</strong> Voice-first in Urdu and English.</li>
    <li><strong>Intelligent & Fair:</strong> Mathematical urgency scoring without bureaucratic favoritism.</li>
    <li><strong>Accountable:</strong> Every repair backed by photographic proof and citizen confirmation.</li>
    <li><strong>Live System:</strong> Operational at <code>http://localhost:3000</code>.</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="speaker-notes">
    <strong>Speaker Notes:</strong> "CivicFix AI bridges the gap between citizens and their local government. By making grievance reporting as easy as speaking a voice note, and making resolution as transparent as a photo proof, we restore citizen trust and create cleaner, safer cities. Thank you, and we welcome any questions."
  </div>
</div>

<hr/>

<h2>Live Demonstration Sequence (5-Step Demo Script)</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Landing Page & Brand:</strong> Open <code>http://localhost:3000</code>. Point out the interactive blue cursor-following gradient, verified database counters, and modern logo.</li>
  <li><strong>Citizen Voice Intake:</strong> Click <em>"Report a Problem"</em>. Toggle between Urdu and English. Record or type a complaint in Roman Urdu (*"Road broken near school and water overflowing"*). Show the AI extracting category, location, and hazard factors in real-time.</li>
  <li><strong>Urgency Rules Simulator:</strong> Navigate to <code>/admin/simulator</code>. Demonstrate how toggling monsoon rain forecasts or school proximity changes the score from 4/10 to 9/10 with transparent explanations.</li>
  <li><strong>Officer Dispatch & Worker View:</strong> Open <code>/officer</code> queue sorted by urgency. Assign a worker. Switch to the worker view to show task instructions and geo-tagged 'After' photo upload.</li>
  <li><strong>Verified Resolution & Citizen 1-Click Confirmation:</strong> Upload resolution photo with perceptual hash fraud check. Open <code>/track/CF-1042</code> to show the Before/After photo comparison slider and the citizen's 1-click <em>"Confirm Fix"</em> button.</li>
</ol>

